title The seed stands at its gate
prompt Keaton: publish seed when you're all done -- the closing line of a grant covering eight laps.
think Two of the eight laps have landed and six are booked, so the condition on the publish is unmet by its own words. What IS done is the half publish-seed.sh calls agent-doable, and running it proves the whole chain works with a room newly allowed into it.
think The bare form projects, proves, commits, and stops -- a script whose bare invocation stops at a custody gate is the shape the card's law asks for, and --push is the word typed once at the moment it is meant.
obs THE SEED CARRIES GRATITUDE AND CARRIES IT CLEAN. 7,943 files committed, 123 of them under gratitude, author grain-ww and keyless, parents 0, SOW_WITNESS_GREEN with IDENT_CLEAN and NO_PERSONAL. Every one of the twenty gitlinks is absent and so is the saved third-party article, checked by name rather than by count.
obs A GREP NEARLY GAVE ME A FALSE LEAK. Checking the withheld classes by prefix matched gratitude/zig-wayland.md -- a thanks page, not the gratitude/zig submodule. Rechecked with a trailing slash per module: twenty absences, each named. A prefix is not a path, and a leak check that cannot tell them apart would cry wolf until somebody stopped listening.
obs THE CARD ARRIVED SIX BYTES FROM FULL AND THE BOOKING COST A CAIRN. 40,954 of 40,960 after the rebase; the booking line went in three times, shorter each time, and the room came from condensing two shelf-pointer lines and a habit paragraph in Prior laps. The parenthesis that fell -- TASKS.md and ROADMAP.md fused here on 20260823.103804 -- is on the cairn, because fixtures still name those files.
loom seed files=7943 gratitude=123 parents=0 signed=none author=grain-ww
loom seed gitlinks_absent=20 article_absent=yes ident=CLEAN no_personal=yes
loom card bytes=40871 ceiling=40960 free=89
file construction/ITINERARY.md the booking as a pointer, and Prior laps condensed to make room
file construction/CHECKPOINTS.md the cairn naming the parenthesis that fell
scope the seed projected, proven, and committed at custody gate %1 -- the push withheld
status GREEN -- SOW_WITNESS_GREEN, pin guard green, readme_reach broken_in_living=0, tracked links ok
recommend check in (Keaton) -- one word crosses gate %1, and the program's own reasoning says it waits for laps C through H.
